The '''Mutant Tarantula''' is a [[Mob]] and {{MobCategory|Slayer Miniboss}} which spawns very rarely when a player doing the [[Tarantula Broodfather]] {{SlayerTier|IV}} quest kills a spider. 

== Spawning ==
'''Mutant Tarantulas''' spawn rarely during [[Tarantula Broodfather]] {{SlayerTier|IV}} quests when the player kills a Spider-type mob. When this happens, an explosion effect takes place and the Mutant Tarantula spawns.

