== Behavior ==
The '''Mutant Tarantula''' has {{Hp|576k}}. It seeks out and attacks the nearest player, preferring the player who spawned it.

It moves more slowly than its cousin the [[Tarantula Beast]]. However, it is far more deadly, dealing 5,000 damage per hit - enough to kill players wearing maxed out [[Tarantula Armor]] within 5 hits.

== Tips ==
*A particular strategy to beating this miniboss is to gain lower ground; standing on a ledge 2 blocks beneath the miniboss, will generally make it land no hits against the player, and with virtually any decent late game sword, such as a {{Item|Scorpion Foil}}, one can take down a '''Mutant Tarantula'''. 
*Players can also lure the miniboss to a place far enough for the AI of the miniboss to stop working. This will make the miniboss not be aggravated and one can easily kill it down with no risk.

